For those who didn't get a default player, or are having trouble getting
started: I got a default player. No abilities with any spells, one
extra life, 500 gold. Works quite well.

Note: Attack spells cost 600 gold. Armor spell costs 200 (and works
better than anything you can afford at the beginning). Glow
costs 200 (and is about as good as a torch, but reusable). Another
100 gets you a short short or dagger and shield.


